			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740750101,
					"content": "「此处乃灵魂之象限，灵魂之庙宇，灵魂之间」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750102,
					"content": "「伴你长眠」…「生于一瞬，常与相违，从不分离」…「人间至宝」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750103,
					"content": "呼——这次没有可怕的东西了。解答是，一个怀表？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750104,
					"content": "说来，安是不是也有一个来着？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750105,
					"content": "表的话，确实很贵吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740750106,
					"content": "所以答案就是钱，也就是摩拉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750107,
					"content": "和钱一起永眠了可是人生第二大悲剧啊。以及不要问第一大是什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750108,
					"content": "那第一悲剧是什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750109,
					"content": "这个我知道，答案是「身无分文地躺在棺材里」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750110,
					"content": "这个价值观不太好哦。世界上更重要的东西有很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750111,
					"content": "所以我说了别问啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750112,
					"content": "我很抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750113,
					"content": "话说回来吧。基于上面的原因，我不认为答案会是名表或者摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750114,
					"content": "那会是什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750115,
					"content": "答案很简单，这个能检索到类似的谜语，匹配率百分之七十。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750116,
					"content": "出自几百年前的古典小说，原文「我生于一瞬的视线相交，背对着追求之人奔跑。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750117,
					"content": "「…割掉所有的肉、骨与内脏，我仍在骨髓中与你同床。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750118,
					"content": "答案是「爱」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750119,
					"content": "这样就理解了。这枚怀表和我的那枚怀表一样，里面一定也有充满爱的回忆吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750120,
					"content": "那块怀表能打开就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740750121,
					"content": "嗯嗯，总有天会打开它的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750122,
					"content": "笨狗狗，做的不错！你是最可爱的机械狗狗了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750123,
					"content": "我的荣幸。不过可爱是个主观形容，我的理想称呼是「可靠、耐用的原型机4ACV07」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750124,
					"content": "嗯嗯，这就是为什么你这么可爱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750125,
					"content": "…你俩是不是在引经据典。我总感觉我看过这一幕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740750126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740750126,
					"content": "无论如何，这里的谜题已经被他人解开。我们尽快行动吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				}
			]
		},
